<h1 class="email-heading">Your email address was changed</h1>
<p class="email-text">
  The email address on your JobJournal account was changed from <strong><%= @previous_email %></strong> to <strong><%= @user.email_address %></strong>. Any other sessions on your account were signed out.
</p>
<a href="<%= security_url %>" class="email-button">Review Active Sessions</a>
<p class="email-note">
  If this was you, there’s nothing to do. If it wasn’t, reply to this email right away and we’ll help you get your account back.
</p>
